NetEase login security runtimes
-------------------------------
The private PC QR-login compatibility path contains minimized device and
WatchMan bytecode (`netease-device-sdk.dex`), the official device-ID bytecode
(`netease-device-id-sdk.dex`), plus the ARM64 native runtimes
(`libnesdk.so`, `libnetmobsec-4.4.7.so`, `libnetdev-1.0.0.so`, and
`libAegisSDK.so`) and the URS login/captcha bytecode, key data, and native
runtimes (`netease-urs-*.dex`, `key_*.dat`, `app_sign_private.dat`,
`device_info_public.dat`, `error_log_public.dat`,
`netease_official_signing_certificate.der`, `libursandroidunity.so`, and
`libnedat.so`) extracted from the official NetEase Cloud Music Android app
version 9.5.70. These files are
proprietary NetEase components; no open-source or redistribution license was
found. They are included only for private interoperability testing and must be
removed or separately licensed before public distribution.

